  [ 15] setlocal 0
  [ 17] getlocal 0
  [ 19] pushint8 20 ............................. <20>
  [ 22] lteq
  [ 23] jmpifz [ 55] ............................ repeat with i = 1 to 20
  [ 26] getlocal 0 .............................. <i>
  [ 28] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 29] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <i, 0>
  [ 31] extcall 15 .............................. puppetSprite(i, 0)
  [ 33] getlocal 0 .............................. <i>
  [ 35] pusharglist 1 ........................... <i>
  [ 37] extcall 16 .............................. <sprite(i)>
